{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"像又遇见当初不知所措的自己，走过这一路问题还是没答案\",\"source\":\"最初的问题又浮上来，却没有因此得到一个简单的答案。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把“没有得到一个简单的答案”说成“没答案”，丢掉了原文保留的余地，变成更绝对的判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子；明知回去未必找得回那份亲近，心里还是忍不住想：万一能呢？\",\"source\":\"明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"屏幕稿先出现拒绝回去的决定，后出现促使他心动的“万一能呢”，颠倒了原文先被希望牵动、再拒绝只凭希望回去的心理推进顺序。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"可他不再怪自己当初离开，更不愿只为有人陪着就回头；他愿意带着想念继续过日子；想起好时候还是会心软、也怕一个人熬，却仍能决定自己怎么站立\",\"source\":\"想起那些好时候，他还是会心软，也怕往后一个人熬，可他不再怪自己当初离开，更不愿只为有人陪着就回头；他愿意带着想念继续过日子。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把原文先出现的心软和怕独自熬挪到了不再自责、决定继续生活之后，改变了原文的心理推进顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "81ca74a8-271c-4135-85af-dbc0df40ab2e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T044137993294Z", "elapsed_seconds": 285.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:46:23.068052+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1bcde82a45fa5e2371fbe7748eb2425603e0c2ab533066586006a94adb4b131b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T044137993294Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9f7dfcc62962be41a3e9a965bd4916c669fd42cecb99d073e02e07f772126f3e"}}}
